@startuml
title Native Codex teammate lifecycle

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Routed : Claude invokes teammate command
Routed --> Starting : model selects Codex engine

Starting : Parse identity and role
Starting : Build isolated Codex config
Starting : Start normal TUI/thread
Starting : Install external-team extension

Starting --> Joining : provider waits for complete roster entry
Joining --> Failed : unsupported version or identity mismatch
Joining --> Working : initial NEW_TASK submitted

Working --> Working : mailbox message during active turn
Working --> Idle : turn completes
Idle --> Working : Claude/task/cron/loop/monitor event
Idle --> Working : operator enters TUI input

Working --> Interrupted : parent interrupt or operator interrupt
Interrupted --> Working : follow-up native communication
Interrupted --> Idle : no pending work

Working --> Stopping : approved shutdown or roster removal
Idle --> Stopping : approved shutdown or roster removal
Interrupted --> Stopping : approved shutdown or roster removal

Stopping : stop child agents
Stopping : cancel monitors and terminals
Stopping : stop scheduler; any lease expires <= 30s
Stopping : flush rollout and journal
Stopping : send lifecycle acknowledgment
Stopping : stop sibling Code Mode host

Stopping --> [*]

Failed : visible error; no silent Claude fallback
Failed --> [*]
@enduml
